412
00:19:50,240 --> 00:19:52,039
[The Bureau is the Crown's eyes,]

413
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:54,079
[yet of late it grows reckless.]

414
00:19:54,799 --> 00:19:55,960
[Unbridled,]

415
00:19:56,279 --> 00:19:57,480
[and it shall breed ruin.]

416
00:19:58,839 --> 00:20:00,480
[All I do is]

417
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:01,480
[for the peace]

418
00:20:01,480 --> 00:20:03,079
[of the realm.]

419
00:20:03,799 --> 00:20:04,960
[Hold fast]

420
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:08,000
[to your honor,]

421
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:10,839
[and do not be deceived by whispers.]

422
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:14,319
[He seeks to guide me.]

423
00:20:15,279 --> 00:20:16,559
[He reins us in]

424
00:20:17,039 --> 00:20:18,880
[only so the Bureau]

425
00:20:19,839 --> 00:20:20,759
[can truly]

426
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:22,880
