427
00:20:29,519 --> 00:20:31,559
A fair night,

428
00:20:31,799 --> 00:20:33,480
Your Majesty.

429
00:20:34,319 --> 00:20:35,079
Behold,

430
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:36,079
