431
00:20:36,079 --> 00:20:37,640
and the fish thrive.

432
00:20:37,839 --> 00:20:39,200
May your reign

433
00:20:39,519 --> 00:20:40,920
be forever peaceful!

434
00:20:41,559 --> 00:20:42,200
Your Majesty!

435
00:20:43,559 --> 00:20:44,200
Your Majesty!

436
00:20:44,960 --> 00:20:45,559
A message

437
00:20:46,079 --> 00:20:46,839
from Lord Shen.

438
00:20:46,839 --> 00:20:47,960
A matter of grave import.

439
00:20:51,119 --> 00:20:52,200
[My search has]

440
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:53,160
[revealed secret forges]

441
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:54,079
[where the empire meets]

442
00:20:54,079 --> 00:20:55,000
[the frozen waste]

443
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:56,680
[of Northsunder.]

444
00:20:57,480 --> 00:20:58,920
[The ghosts of Midvale are]

445
00:20:59,119 --> 00:21:00,119
