452
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:10,960
Aye!

453
00:21:10,960 --> 00:21:11,640
Your Majesty,

454
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:13,400
the rot of

455
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:14,119
