521
00:23:26,200 --> 00:23:26,920
The next trade is near.

522
00:23:26,920 --> 00:23:28,359
The dealer is a cutthroat

523
00:23:28,839 --> 00:23:30,400
named Lyu Da.

524
00:23:31,079 --> 00:23:32,240
So the Tiger Roar Gang dally with

525
00:23:32,240 --> 00:23:34,359
