526
00:23:34,960 --> 00:23:36,640
Let them sow the seeds;

527
00:23:37,279 --> 00:23:38,759
we shall reap

528
00:23:38,759 --> 00:23:40,279
the harvest.

529
00:23:41,079 --> 00:23:42,279
The boy emperor

530
00:23:42,559 --> 00:23:44,680
sits on a fractured throne.

531
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:46,440
When the tide turns,

532
00:23:46,880 --> 00:23:48,240
Midvale

533
00:23:48,519 --> 00:23:50,519
shall rise in glory!

534
00:23:51,400 --> 00:23:53,079
Eternal soars the Dark Bird!

535
00:23:53,079 --> 00:23:54,640
Forever shines the Crimson Moon!

536
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:56,039
Eternal soars the Dark Bird!

537
00:23:56,039 --> 00:23:57,759
Forever shines the Crimson Moon!

538
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:03,880
Good sir...

539
00:24:20,599 --> 00:24:21,319
I

540
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:23,359
beg you...

541
00:24:23,359 --> 00:24:24,559
