542
00:24:24,759 --> 00:24:26,359
The bliss is too short!

543
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:27,920
It lasts scarcely a dozen heartbeats!

544
00:24:31,079 --> 00:24:32,559
I meant no offense...

545
00:24:59,759 --> 00:25:00,839
I bring forth

546
00:25:01,359 --> 00:25:02,519
