551
00:25:10,359 --> 00:25:11,519
A man must

552
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:14,079
buy for a sennight before he craves more.

553
00:25:14,400 --> 00:25:15,599
You scrape

554
00:25:16,680 --> 00:25:18,319
