555
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:21,200
Speak your name, or bleed!

556
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:29,119
The herald of your fortune.

557
00:25:30,359 --> 00:25:31,559
Behold, Godsgrain.

558
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:34,400
A single lick strengthens the blood.

559
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:35,920
One dose,

560
00:25:36,359 --> 00:25:38,640
even the God of War

561
00:25:38,960 --> 00:25:39,880
