593
00:27:26,279 --> 00:27:27,160
Cease your weeping.

594
00:27:28,440 --> 00:27:30,359
This is no Orcus' Hall.

595
00:27:30,799 --> 00:27:31,559
The door is there.

596
00:27:32,319 --> 00:27:33,160
Leave if

597
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:35,720
